From 835f453ffeaf5fd6e2d23c1fc854ffd9f2436943 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:30:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 265/275] fix(execution): close U3 round-2 findings from
 verify-0046-u3

Independent verification (verify-0046-u3 @ 7378aa943) refuted seven claims
in the U3 discovery slice.  This commit keeps discovery behavior for real
snapshots while closing each counterexample:

* strict snapshot import is now type-strict recursively: bool/int and
  int/float conflations, unknown/missing nested keys, duplicate provider_id
  values and known-opcode contract digests are refused before canonical
  equality; JSON documents are parsed with an object_pairs_hook that rejects
  duplicate keys at any depth and parse_constant rejects NaN/Infinity;
* doctor reports self-consistent but unregistered contract opcodes / provider
  identities as failed fail-closed facts (default rc 0) instead of raising;
* the CLI converts every parse/serialization failure into a structured
  ExecutionError document (rc 1, no traceback); a catch-all keeps internal
  failures structured too;
* the capability-snapshot digest preimage uses the exported schema_version
  key, so sha256(canon(export minus digest)) == digest is directly
  verifiable; the plan wrapper gains its own canonical top-level digest and
  explain --plan verifies it;
* doctor --strict fail-closed exit code is 3 (argparse usage errors stay 2),
  documented in --help and 0013 section 3.5 with a test asserting the codes
  differ;
* doctor/plan redact host-absolute library paths to the basename by default
  (sha256/arch stay); --show-paths / show_paths=True is the explicit opt-in
  and path_policy participates in the digest;
* the fail-closed check wording is now "8 distinct check names" (11 rows on
  this host), matching the implementation.

Two registered boundaries are pinned by tests and documented in 0013:
same-triple weaker snapshots (fewer features/providers) are accepted by the
kind+triple alignment rule, and report resolution.why is an un-anchored
explanation-layer copy that explain echoes without endorsing (a boundaries
entry now states this explicitly).

Focused evidence: 55 discovery tests, 391 execution-related tests, collect
2020 (base 1994, +26).  The adapted independent repros pass: strict nested
matrix (14+ cases refused), doctor unknown contract (rc 0 / strict rc 3),
CLI unstructured errors (4/4 structured), digest preimage recompute, and
the 80-case tamper ledger with 0 violations.
